{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a new Shopify Online Store 2.0 section with a two-column editorial layout in the Bonne Soirée style — minimal, timeless, refined, and inspired by luxury fashion editorials.
    
    Purpose:
    
    Display one editorial image alongside structured text content.
    
    The section should be fully customizable from the Shopify Theme Editor without requiring code changes.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    LAYOUT
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Desktop:
    
    • Two-column layout.
    • Image on the left.
    • Text on the right.
    • Columns should have balanced proportions.
    • The text block must always be vertically centered relative to the image.
    • Keep subtle spacing between image and text (clean editorial composition).
    • Plenty of white space, but never excessive.
    • Maximum section width around 1280px.
    • Center the entire section horizontally.
    
    Mobile:
    
    • Stack the image above the text.
    • Keep proportional spacing between the image and text.
    • Maintain generous side padding.
    • Preserve the selected text alignment.
    • Fully responsive.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    IMAGE
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Support independent Desktop and Mobile images.
    
    Settings:
    
    • Desktop image picker.
    • Mobile image picker.
    • If no mobile image is uploaded, automatically display the desktop image.
    
    Image behavior:
    
    • Preserve the original aspect ratio.
    • width: 100%.
    • height: auto.
    • object-fit: contain.
    • Never crop the image.
    • No rounded corners.
    • No borders.
    • No shadows.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    TEXT CONTENT
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Create THREE independent Rich Text blocks.
    
    Each block should be individually editable.
    
    Block 1
    Main Title
    
    Block 2
    First Subtitle
    
    Block 3
    Second Subtitle / Body Text
    
    Each text block must support Shopify Rich Text formatting.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    TYPOGRAPHY CONTROLS
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Each text block must have its own independent typography settings inside the Theme Editor.
    
    For EACH of the three text blocks include:
    
    • Shopify Font Picker (font family)
    • Font size
    • Font weight
    • Letter spacing
    • Line height
    
    Do not hardcode fonts.
    
    Default font:
    Times New Roman (or the store's primary serif font).
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    TEXT ALIGNMENT
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Create one global Text Alignment setting.
    
    Options:
    
    • Left
    • Center
    • Right
    
    Default:
    
    Center
    
    The selected alignment must apply to all three text blocks.
    
    When Center is selected:
    
    • The entire text composition must be centered inside the right column.
    • Not only the text itself, but the whole text group.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    TEXT SPACING
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Include adjustable spacing controls for:
    
    • Title → Subtitle 1
    • Subtitle 1 → Subtitle 2
    
    Allow independent spacing values.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    BACKGROUND
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Background color selector.
    
    Default colors:
    
    • #FFFFFF
    • #F9F8F5
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    SECTION SPACING
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Include editable controls for:
    
    • Top padding
    • Bottom padding
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    OPTIONAL LAYOUT SETTINGS
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Include a Layout Direction selector.
    
    Options:
    
    • Image Left / Text Right (default)
    • Text Left / Image Right
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    STYLE
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    The overall feeling should be elegant, minimal and editorial.
    
    Inspired by luxury fashion brands such as Toteme, Khaite, The Row and Sézane.
    
    The composition should resemble a printed fashion magazine.
    
    Use generous but balanced white space.
    
    The typography should feel premium and timeless.
    
    The section must be fully responsive and compatible with Shopify Online Store 2.0., BUTTON
    
    Include an optional button inside the text column.
    
    The button must appear directly below the three text fields, inside the same text content area.
    
    It must not be rendered below the entire section or outside the two-column layout.
    
    Button settings:
    
    - Button label
    - Button link
    - Show or hide button
    - Button alignment: left, center, or right
    - Button style: outline or solid
    - Button text color
    - Button background color
    - Button border color
    - Button border thickness
    - Button font family using Shopify font_picker
    - Button font size
    - Button letter spacing
    - Horizontal padding
    - Vertical padding
    - Spacing above the button
    
    Default style:
    
    - Outline button
    - Transparent background
    - Black text
    - Thin black border
    - No rounded corners
    - Uppercase text
    - Minimal and editorial appearance
    
    The button should follow the selected text alignment.
    
    When text alignment is set to center, the button must also be centered within the right column.
    
    The button must remain inside the text block on desktop.
    
    On mobile, after the image stacks above the text, the button should remain directly below the text content inside the same section. Group the Main Title, First Subtitle, Second Subtitle and Button inside one shared text-content wrapper.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-editorial-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding-top: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-editorial-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 40px;
  }

  .ai-editorial-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-editorial-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-editorial-reverse-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  }

  .ai-editorial-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-editorial-reverse-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-editorial-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    order: 2;
  }

  .ai-editorial-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-editorial-reverse-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-editorial-text-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    order: 1;
  }

  .ai-editorial-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-editorial-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .ai-editorial-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
    min-height: 400px;
  }

  .ai-editorial-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 500px;
    max-height: 500px;
  }

  .ai-editorial-empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 20px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    padding: 12px 20px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #666;
    text-align: center;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .ai-editorial-text-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    {% if block.settings.text_alignment == 'center' %}
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    {% elsif block.settings.text_alignment == 'right' %}
      align-items: flex-end;
      text-align: right;
    {% else %}
      align-items: flex-start;
      text-align: left;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-editorial-text-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-editorial-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.title_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.title_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.title_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.title_letter_spacing }}em;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.title_line_height }};
    margin: 0;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .ai-editorial-subtitle-1-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.subtitle_1_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.subtitle_1_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.subtitle_1_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle_1_font_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.subtitle_1_letter_spacing }}em;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.subtitle_1_line_height }};
    margin: 0;
    margin-top: {{ block.settings.spacing_title_subtitle_1 }}px;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .ai-editorial-subtitle-2-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.subtitle_2_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.subtitle_2_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.subtitle_2_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle_2_font_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.subtitle_2_letter_spacing }}em;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.subtitle_2_line_height }};
    margin: 0;
    margin-top: {{ block.settings.spacing_subtitle_1_subtitle_2 }}px;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .ai-editorial-button-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-top: {{ block.settings.button_spacing_top }}px;
    {% if block.settings.button_alignment == 'center' %}
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
    {% elsif block.settings.button_alignment == 'right' %}
      display: flex;
      justify-content: flex-end;
    {% else %}
      display: flex;
      justify-content: flex-start;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-editorial-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.button_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.button_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.button_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.button_letter_spacing }}em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
    padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_horizontal }}px;
    border-radius: 0;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
    {% if block.settings.button_style == 'solid' %}
      background-color: {{ block.settings.button_background_color }};
      color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
      border: {{ block.settings.button_border_thickness }}px solid {{ block.settings.button_background_color }};
    {% else %}
      background-color: transparent;
      color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
      border: {{ block.settings.button_border_thickness }}px solid {{ block.settings.button_border_color }};
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-editorial-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    {% if block.settings.button_style == 'solid' %}
      opacity: 0.8;
    {% else %}
      background-color: {{ block.settings.button_border_color }};
      color: {{ block.settings.button_background_color }};
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-editorial-mobile-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-editorial-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 0 24px;
    }

    .ai-editorial-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .ai-editorial-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-editorial-reverse-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-editorial-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      order: 1;
    }

    .ai-editorial-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-editorial-reverse-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-editorial-text-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      order: 2;
    }

    .ai-editorial-desktop-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      {% if block.settings.image_mobile %}
        display: none;
      {% endif %}
    }

    .ai-editorial-mobile-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      {% if block.settings.image_mobile %}
        display: block;
      {% endif %}
    }

    .ai-editorial-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      min-height: 300px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<editorial-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}
  class="ai-editorial-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>
  <div class="ai-editorial-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-editorial-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {% if block.settings.layout_direction == 'text_left' %}ai-editorial-reverse-{{ ai_gen_id }}{% endif %}">
      <div class="ai-editorial-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.image_desktop %}
          <img
            src="{{ block.settings.image_desktop | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
            alt="{{ block.settings.image_desktop.alt | escape }}"
            loading="lazy"
            width="{{ block.settings.image_desktop.width }}"
            height="{{ block.settings.image_desktop.height }}"
            class="ai-editorial-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-editorial-desktop-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          >
        {% else %}
          <div class="ai-editorial-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
            <div class="ai-editorial-empty-state-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              Add a desktop image
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.image_mobile %}
          <img
            src="{{ block.settings.image_mobile | image_url: width: 800 }}"
            alt="{{ block.settings.image_mobile.alt | escape }}"
            loading="lazy"
            width="{{ block.settings.image_mobile.width }}"
            height="{{ block.settings.image_mobile.height }}"
            class="ai-editorial-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-editorial-mobile-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          >
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="ai-editorial-text-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-editorial-text-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.title != blank %}
            <div class="ai-editorial-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.title }}
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.subtitle_1 != blank %}
            <div class="ai-editorial-subtitle-1-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.subtitle_1 }}
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.subtitle_2 != blank %}
            <div class="ai-editorial-subtitle-2-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.subtitle_2 }}
            </div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.show_button and block.settings.button_label != blank %}
            <div class="ai-editorial-button-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <a
                href="{{ block.settings.button_link }}"
                class="ai-editorial-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
              >
                {{ block.settings.button_label }}
              </a>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</editorial-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class EditorialSection{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
      }
    }

    customElements.define('editorial-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}', EditorialSection{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

